#. 戦刃むくろの<CLT 3>右手<CLT>には、
#. タトゥーがあったはずだよね？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Mukuro had a tattoo on her <CLT 3>right hand<CLT>, if I remember\n"
"correctly."
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルを表す…<CLT 3>狼のタトゥー<CLT>だよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"A \"representation of Fenrir\"... In other words, a\n"
"<CLT 3>wolf tattoo<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. でも、ボクを襲った覆面の人物の右手には…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I saw the right hand of the person who attacked\n"
"me..."
msgstr ""

#. そんなタトゥーなんてなかったんだ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...and there was no such tattoo."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、あの覆面の正体が、
#. 戦刃むくろだとは考えられないんだ！
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So there's no way the person behind the mask was\n"
"Mukuro!"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…確かに…
#. 戦刃むくろではなかったみたいだね…
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Y-Yeah, well, okay... Ya got me, I guess it wasn't\n"
"her..."
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、だからって、
#. あの覆面の正体がボクとは限らないじゃん！
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "But that still doesn't prove that it was me!"
msgstr ""

#. 他の誰かだったのかもしれないよ？
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It could have been, ya know...someone else, right?"
msgstr ""

#. あの晩、俺と葉隠と腐川と朝日奈には、
#. 確かなアリバイがあるんだ…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hiro, Toko, Hina and I all have solid alibis for that\n"
"entire night."
msgstr ""

#. 俺らは、ずっと体育館でオメーを解体してたんだ！
#. だから、俺らは絶対に違うべ！
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yeah! We were in the gym tearing you apart! So it\n"
"couldn't have been any of us!"
msgstr ""

#. た、確かに…
#. その４人でも…ないのかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "O-Okay, sure, it couldn't have been any of you..."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、霧切さんは！？
#. 彼女だったら可能性があるはずじゃない！？
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "But...what about Kyoko!? It totally could've been her!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. おやおや、反論出来ないの！？
#. ひょっとして、図星！？
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Uh-oh! No snappy comeback? Did I score a bull's-eye?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …わかったわ。じゃあ見せてあげるわよ。
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If you insist, I don't mind showing you."
msgstr ""

#. へ？　見せるって…？
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? Show me what...?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、その覆面の正体が私じゃないって証拠よ…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What do you think? I'll show you the one thing that\n"
"proves beyond a shadow of a doubt it wasn't me."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、そこで霧切さんは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before anyone could say anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>手袋を…外した……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Kyoko was removing her gloves.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そ、その手…！？
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Your hands...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>思わず息を呑んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without thinking, I let out a gasp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>火傷…しかも、ただの火傷じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was more than just a little burned skin...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 酷い火傷…でしょう？
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Awful, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. 私がまだ未熟だった頃の…
#. 探偵として活動を始めたばかりの頃の傷よ…
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It happened when I was first learning to be a\n"
"detective. I was inexperienced..."
msgstr ""

#. それって…人には見せたくない傷じゃ…
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I thought you didn't want anyone to see those scars..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕の正体を暴く為なら…
#. これくらいは、大した事じゃないわ…
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If it means we get another step closer to unmasking\n"
"the mastermind, it doesn't really bother me."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは、噛み締めるように言うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko seemed to savor the words as she said them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その手を、再び手袋の中へとしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then she put her gloves back on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今の火傷の痕が、根拠になるはずよ…
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "My scars should suffice as proof."
msgstr ""

#. だって、苗木君を襲った人物の手には、
#. こんな傷なんてなかったでしょう？
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Makoto, did the person who attacked you have scars\n"
"like mine?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…火傷の痕は見なかったよ…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...not at all, I'm positive."
msgstr ""

#. だったら…これでハッキリしたわね。
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then this much has been made clear..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君を襲った覆面の正体は、
#. 間違いなく、黒幕だったはずよ。
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There can be no doubt that the one who attacked Makoto\n"
"is the true mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うぷぷ…まったく散々だよ…
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... This is just awful!"
msgstr ""

#. 秘密をバラされた上に、
#. 霧切さんのグロい傷まで見させられるなんて…
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"On top of my secret being revealed, I had to look at\n"
"those positively grotesque scars of yours!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ゴメン！　口が滑っちゃった！
#. もしかして傷付いた？
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Ah, sorry! Did I say that out loud? I do hope I didn't\n"
"hurt your feelings...!"
msgstr ""

#. 別に…なんとでも言えばいいわ…
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Not at all. You can say whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#. ボクを追い詰める為なら構わないって？
#. いやいや、まだ追い詰められたとはいかないよ。
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Sure, as long it means pushing me farther into the\n"
"corner, right? But I'm not cornered just yet!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、戦刃むくろ殺しの犯行については、
#. まだ全然、判明してないんだしさ！
msgctxt "0041 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Because if you haven't noticed, the circumstances\n"
"surrounding Mukuro's death are totally unknown!"
msgstr ""

#. 今のところ、わかってるのって…
#. 殺されたのが、かなり前って事だけだね…
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's true... All we know right now is she was killed\n"
"a good while before this morning."
msgstr ""

#. 逆に、それ以外がさっぱりだべ！
msgctxt "0043 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"On the contrary, we don't know anything other than\n"
"that!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺達が閉じ込められる前に、すでに殺されていた…
#. なんて事はないだろうな？
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You're not going to tell us she was already dead\n"
"before we arrived here or something, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…その点については、ご心配に及びません。
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu. In that regard, you have nothing to worry\n"
"about!"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女が殺されたのは、間違いなく、
#. このコロシアイ学園生活が始まった後ですから！
msgctxt "0046 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I promise you, without a doubt, she died after our\n"
"little killing game began here!"
msgstr ""

#. では、戦刃むくろは、
#. 俺達の知らぬ間にひっそりと殺されていたのか…
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then somehow, she was killed in secret, without any of\n"
"us knowing."
msgstr ""

#. しかも、殺されてから、俺らに見つけられるまで、
#. 結構な時間が空いてるんだろ？
msgctxt "0048 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"And after she died, who knows how much time went by\n"
"before we found her, right?"
msgstr ""

#. その間、死体はどこに置いてあったんだ？
#. ずっと植物庭園にあったんか？
msgctxt "0049 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Did the culprit stash her somewhere? She couldn't have\n"
"been in the garden the whole time, could she?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あんな所にずっと置いといたら…腐ってるわよ…
#. それこそ、あんたみたいにね…ッ！
msgctxt "0050 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If she was, she w-would've been totally decomposed...\n"
"Just like your b-brain!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…どこかに保存でもしてたんか？
msgctxt "0051 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Then...she was being stored somewhere?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、死体を隠せて…
#. しかも保存しておける場所なんて…
msgctxt "0052 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But...to hide a body here...to just store it\n"
"somewhere...?"
msgstr ""

#. 生物室
msgctxt "0053 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The bio lab"
msgstr ""

#. プール
msgctxt "0054 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The pool"
msgstr ""

#. プールの水の中に沈めてた…とか…
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm thinking they sunk it to the bottom of the pool."
msgstr ""

#. 変な事、言わないでよ…！
#. プールにはなかったよッ！
msgctxt "0056 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Don't be stupid! It wasn't in the pool!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それに、そんな事したら
#. “どざえもん”になってるって！
msgctxt "0057 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "If you did that, it'd get all bloated and mushy!"
msgstr ""

#. 保存とか…無理だし！
msgctxt "0058 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "There's no way you could preserve a body like that!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに…そうだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah, I think you're absolutely right about that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 厨房
msgctxt "0061 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The kitchen"
msgstr ""

#. なッ！？
#. 厨房の冷蔵庫か！？　そうなんだな！！
msgctxt "0062 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What!? You're thinking they put it in the kitchen\n"
"fridge, right? That's gotta be it!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事、聞いちまったら、
#. 明日から楽しく食事できねーべ！
msgctxt "0063 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Ugh, I'm glad I didn't know before. I never woulda\n"
"been able to eat another meal in there!"
msgstr ""

#. あり得ないわね。
#. あの冷蔵庫に収まるとは思えない。
msgctxt "0064 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Impossible. A body wouldn't have fit in that\n"
"refrigerator."
msgstr ""

#. …そのままの姿ではね。
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Not with how much food was in there."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それって…
msgctxt "0066 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "S-So that means...?"
msgstr ""

#. ヒッ、ヒィィィッ！！
#. やめてくれーっ！！
msgctxt "0067 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hyaaaaaah! Stop talking about it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも厨房だとしたら、
#. さすがに誰かが気付いてるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And if it *had* been in the kitchen, I have to assume\n"
"someone would have noticed it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 推理が間違ってるんじゃないのー？
#. うぷぷ…
msgctxt "0070 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You're wrong about this whole thing, admit it!\n"
"Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体が隠されていた場所…
#. それは、冷蔵庫がある場所で間違いない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no doubt that the body must have been hidden\n"
"somewhere cold.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>そんな場所…１つしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one place...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体が隠されていた場所…
#. あの場所以外には考えられないはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't think of anywhere else the body could have\n"
"been stored...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
